                                                Note #2:




 Although Microsoft does not provide ADMX/ADML templates to configure this registry value, custom templates (                                                                                                                    Configure-IPv6-Components-KB929852.ADMX/ADML




) are provided in the CIS Benchmark Build Kit to facilitate its configuration. Be aware though that simply turning off (not configured) the group policy setting with the template will not "undo" the change once applied. Instead, the opposite setting must be applied to change the registry value to the opposite state.

