xhtml:ul.xhtml:li:
Do not audit any                                                                   NT SERVICE




 SIDs (                                                                  S-1-5-80-




).

xccdf:description.xhtml:p:
If a system has no actively logged-on users, the recommendations in this section are not considered out of compliance. User accounts (                                                        S-1-5-21-*




) that only log on as a service (service accounts), will not receive user configuration settings to its                                                         HKU




 registry hive since the group policy engine will not write to this type of account. Compliance findings for these accounts should be ignored.
